  "prefLabel": "Rev 903.06 Sequence of Distributions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 903.06 Sequence of Distributions. All actual distributions shall be presumed to be sequentially made from:\n\n(a) The current year profit of the organization;\n\n(b) The organization’s accumulated profits; and\n\n(c) The capital of the organization.\n\nSource. #4557, eff 12-28-88; ss by #5947, eff 12-29-94; ss by #6321, eff 8-22-96; ss by #8137, eff 8-10-04; ss by #9658, eff 2-24-10; ss by #9843, eff 12-23-10 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 900); ss by #10211, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13443, eff 8-12-22",
